        "rationale": "The OpenCulture article explicitly states the quote is falsely attributed to Edmund Burke and traces it to John Stuart Mill in 1867 [n4]. No earlier appearance of the saying is provided in the evidence; the Reuters fact‑check notes that Burke did not say it, citing his 1770 work but not showing the quote there [n2]. Thus the saying predates any Burke attribution and originates with Mill, making the Burke credit a misattribution."
